This is the Chromax-MCR platform. A paint manufacturing 
e-commerce site with a custom CMS and admin system. 
Always refer to the project specs in /docs before 
generating any component or page. The design system uses 
Inter + Fraunces fonts, deep navy (#1a1a2e) and gold 
(#E8A020) brand colours, 12px border radius on cards, 
8px on buttons. Tailwind only for styling. TypeScript 
strict mode. App router pattern.
